e-processing and allowing for more diverse asset integration.\n- Spatial 3D Audio: Elevate realism with distance-based sound. You can now create audio objects that dynamically attenuate (fade) as the user moves away from the source, providing a natural sense of scale and presence.\n- Multi-Script State Support: You can now attach and run multiple scripts within a single state. This allows for cleaner organization of complex behaviors and more modular logic design.", "created_date": 1778074020, "id": "26945655385120012", "version": "2.2.3", "version_code": 202031400, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5157340111044853", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26945655385120012"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "744280593379280"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1765378718, "id": "25446629051689327", "version": "2.2.2", "version_code": 202021272, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5157340111044853", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26945655385120012"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "744280593379280"}]}, "change_log": "Improved Performance: Optimized speed for state change transitions.\nSecurity Update: Addressed Unity securi